                  "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
                  "id": "12941907",
                  "source": "PubMed"
                }
              ],
              "value": "(Microbial infection) Integrin ITGA2:ITGB1 acts as a receptor for Human rotavirus A"
            }
          ]
        },
